Ask what the next responsible person must know, obtain or have approved to fulfill this promise. Separate instructions from permissions and secrets. A dependency exists only when the source or actual workflow consequence supports it. Link another obligation by identity when its output is prerequisite; a circular exchange does not make either side ready. Resolve only on actual capability/approval evidence and retain who must act on an unresolved prerequisite.
